<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Alerta de HormiWatch</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #1f2933; background: #f5f7fa; padding: 24px;">
  <div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb;">
    <div style="background: #0DA2E7; padding: 20px 24px;">
      <h2 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px;">[HormiWatch] {{title}}</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="padding: 24px;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px;">Hola {{name}},</p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.5;">{{message}}</p>

      {{#if details.projectTitle}}
      <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #7b8794;">Proyecto</td>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 600;">{{details.projectTitle}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{#if details.customerName}}
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #7b8794;">Cliente</td>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{details.customerName}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
        {{#if details.hoursContracted}}
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #7b8794;">Horas contratadas</td>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{details.hoursContracted}} h</td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
        {{#if details.hoursConsumed}}
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #7b8794;">Horas consumidas</td>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{details.hoursConsumed}} h</td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
        {{#if details.hoursRemaining}}
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #7b8794;">Horas restantes</td>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{details.hoursRemaining}} h</td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
        {{#if details.endDate}}
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #7b8794;">Fecha de vencimiento</td>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{details.endDate}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
        {{#if details.percent}}
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #7b8794;">Consumo</td>
          <td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 600;">{{details.percent}}%</td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
      </table>
      {{/if}}

      <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 16px; background: #fff4e5; border-left: 4px solid #f0a020; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #7a4b00;">
        Acción sugerida: revisa el proyecto y contacta al cliente para definir los próximos pasos.
      </p>

      <p style="margin: 0 0 4px;">
        <a href="https://hormi-watch.vercel.app/projects" style="color: #0DA2E7; font-weight: 600;">Ver en HormiWatch</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding: 16px 24px; background: #f5f7fa; font-size: 12px; color: #7b8794; text-align: center;">
      HormiWatch - Sistema de gestión de proyectos · {{year}}
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
